WEBVTT

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:33.560
Go, Shoot!

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:40.630
We finally started our final
battle with Ozma's team.

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:43.740
To protect the Sacred Beasts,

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:48.530
Takao and the team rise to
the challenge to unseal Byakko.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:37.220
Sharcrash!

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:42.080
Max puts everything on the line in his
battle against Mariam, and defeats her.

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:44.400
And managed
to protect Genbu.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:50.500
The next challenger will be...

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:16.280
Who's gonna fall victim to
the one and only Dunga?

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:17.970
I'll fight you.

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:19.180
Kai!

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:21.930
I had a feeling
it'd be you.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:26.190
We've still got unfinished business
to take care of, Kai Hiwatari.

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:28.310
So we'll finish it here.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:33.060
I'm looking forward to it.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:36.240
You better not lose, Kai!

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:37.610
Go for it!

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:45.400
Kai Hiwatari, huh?
This is going to be a good battle.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:47.890
Now's the time for you to
finish him for good, Dunga!

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:51.970
In the name of the Saint Shields,
I'm gonna beat your Suzaku!

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:55.540
If you can beat me, that is!

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:56.930
What?!

00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:00.280
Kai's not acting
like his usual self.

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:05.140
Dunga is someone Kai
just has to defeat.

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:06.780
Follow me!

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:09.690
Hey!

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:21.810
Don't tell me they're
going to battle up there?

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:26.610
Kai, this is where you
and Suzaku are gonna die!

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:38.900
That's where Suzaku's
new home is gonna be.

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:43.220
Lying right next to Byakko
in that stone tablet!

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:53.300
Kai...

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:56.820
Rei, I promise I'll
get Byakko back.

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.730
Dunga, it's time to battle.

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:01.630
Let's do it! Go, Shoot!

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:06.220
Go, Voltic Ape!

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:08.130
Dranzer!

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:18.250
Kai...

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.170
You can do it, Dranzer!

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:29.410
Wow...

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:31.990
I can hardly keep up!

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:34.190
They're all the
way up there now!

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:39.290
Damn!

00:05:53.810 --> 00:05:55.330
What happened?

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.520
Dunga's Beyblade is gone!

00:05:57.520 --> 00:05:59.960
Where? Where is it?

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.310
Now, Dunga!

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:03.810
Look up, Kai!
He's above you!

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:05.430
What?!

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:09.180
Voltic Ape!!

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:18.130
Take somma this!

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:26.550
Look out!

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:27.490
Kai!

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.810
Suzaku!

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:48.530
How is Dranzer?

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:50.800
It's fine. It's still spinning!

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:52.120
Darn...

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:56.850
Damn him... Don't let
him get away, Voltic Ape!

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:03.620
Suzaku!

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:07.840
This is the first time Dunga's Sacred Beast
has shown off this much attack power!

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:10.320
He plans on
finishing this now.

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:21.120
Suzaku's fighting back!

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:23.810
That's it!
Keep it up, Kai!

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:26.110
Dunga, you're pathetic!

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:27.090
Yusuf...

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:30.190
Damn!

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:32.360
Finish him, Dranzer!

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:34.250
Not on my watch!

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:36.580
Vanishing Moot!

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:49.490
Two on one is low!

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.660
Takao, are you okay?

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:55.440
Ozma!

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:57.790
Kinomiya, I won't
let you interfere.

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:58.820
What?!

00:07:58.820 --> 00:08:00.860
This is no ordinary battle.

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:06.970
It's the Saint Shields' ceremony to seal
the four Sacred Beasts once and for all!

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:10.990
A ceremony?
Get real! It's cheating!

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:14.730
You can call it what you want,
but I won't let you stop them!

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:20.030
Come on out,
Vanishing Moot!

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:34.720
Rei!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.470
Are you okay, Takao?

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:52.640
Where's Rei?
Where'd he go?

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.760
Rei!

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.280
Stop!

00:08:57.280 --> 00:09:00.460
It's crazy to barge
in without Byakko!

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:01.980
I know it's crazy!

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:04.630
You're gonna break Driger!

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:10.260
I know! But I can't
abandon Kai, no, Suzaku!

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:12.720
Go, Driger!

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:19.810
You don't know
when to quit!

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:28.210
I won't let you
lay a finger on him!

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:30.610
Now you're just
making fun of me...

00:09:30.990 --> 00:09:34.690
I don't think you realize
how fearsome we can be!

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:37.390
Take 'em down, Voltic Ape!

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:49.720
Go, Driger!

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:51.410
Leave this to me, Rei!

00:09:51.410 --> 00:09:54.780
I'll fight on my own
without getting in your way!

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:57.200
Suit yourself.

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.520
Darn, if this keeps
up Suzaku will...

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:05.010
This is bad!
What should we do?

00:10:05.010 --> 00:10:07.380
It's far too reckless.

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:09.990
As long as Driger
is without Byakko,

00:10:09.990 --> 00:10:14.710
Dranzer and Suzaku will have
to fight against two opponents.

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:24.930
Dranzer's wide open!
Charge in and take him down!

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:28.420
Voltic Ape!

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:32.720
Kai!

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:35.620
Dranzer!!

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:44.430
Suzaku!

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:02.930
The rail's been cut off!

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:04.420
Oh no!

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:05.170
Darn!

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:07.010
Hang on tight, Rei!

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:13.330
Hey, come on!
Is that all you got?

00:11:14.470 --> 00:11:17.020
Here I come!
It's all over!

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.210
No way!

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:23.990
Everyone's Beys will...!

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:25.430
Kai! Rei!

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:26.640
Ozma...

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:46.600
Get outta there!

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:05.260
Kai! Rei!

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:06.830
Are you okay?!

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:12.670
Thank goodness,
they're okay!

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:17.000
They're still battling!

00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:22.820
Go, Driger!

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:27.810
Get lost!

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:32.900
Dranzer!

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:41.700
Dunga! Yusuf!
Stay on Suzaku!

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:43.280
Let's do it, Dunga!

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.440
Voltic Ape!!

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:57.860
The Sacred Beasts
are acting weird!

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:01.460
They're in pain because
of the heat and smoke!

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:06.420
The entire field is dangerous!
It's hardly a place where Beyblades can battle!

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:18.100
Kai, Rei, get back!
You can't battle like this!

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:19.870
Dranzer!

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:28.310
I thought I told you,
this is where Suzaku dies!

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:29.410
What?

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:39.840
Vanishing Moot,
Voltic Ape, hang in there.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:44.300
We will seal Suzaku even
if it costs you your lives!

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:45.910
What?!

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:49.010
Ozma, why are
you okay with this?

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:53.760
What do you think a Sacred Beast is,
anyway? And you call yourselves Bladers?!

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:58.490
Before Bladers, we are the
Saint Shields and we have a mission!

00:13:58.490 --> 00:14:01.540
One we must complete even
at the cost of our own lives.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.840
You lot would
never understand it!

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:07.090
Yeah, I don't!
I would never!

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:12.210
You guys go on about how Sacred
Beasts are dangerous or whatever,

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:15.230
but this is what happens
when you think that way!

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:20.140
You don't care about them!
They're just tools to you!

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:21.700
Silence, Kinomiya!

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:24.340
Dunga! Yusuf!
Defeat Suzaku!

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:26.700
Go, Voltic Ape!

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:28.710
Vanishing Moot!

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:53.560
Take this!

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:55.910
Good going, Kai!
Time to fight back!

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:58.330
This is really bad!

00:14:58.560 --> 00:14:59.920
Over there!

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:04.370
If those wires make
contact, it might explode!

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:07.700
Kai! Rei!
Get out of there now!

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:09.060
Driger!

00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:23.920
What does Rei
think he's doing?

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:25.890
It's the connecting switch.

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:30.290
He's trying to pull the switch so he can
save their Beyblades and Sacred Beasts.

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:43.650
What are you doing?
Without Byakko, Driger is nothing!

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:46.130
Both of you, beat Dranzer!

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:49.300
Vanishing Moot!

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:55.220
Go, Voltic Ape!

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:07.940
Rei!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.880
I will not lose...

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.910
I refuse to lose!

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:16.310
Driger!

00:16:25.570 --> 00:16:27.670
Go, Vanishing Moot!

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:29.640
Push him back, Driger!

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:35.320
Vanishing Moot!

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:49.600
Stop! That's enough, Rei!

00:16:49.600 --> 00:16:53.040
You can't keep this up
without your Sacred Beast!

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:54.290
Stop!

00:16:57.090 --> 00:17:00.090
I can't stop here.

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:04.580
For my sealed up Byakko,
I'll fight to the end!

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:07.650
I'll end it here if that's
what you want!

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:10.060
Go, Vanishing Moot!

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:24.890
Stop!!

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:26.350
Rei!

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:27.520
Rei...

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:30.610
That's it! Finish him!

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:32.610
Crush him!

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:41.830
Byakko would look
down on me if I lost here.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:45.170
I won't lose.
I'll never lose.

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:48.380
Driger!!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:03.160
Why would you go
to those lengths, Rei?

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:06.020
What's pushing you so far?

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:09.600
I won't...
Ever give up...

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:15.490
Byakko... I can fight this hard
because you were there for me.

00:18:16.020 --> 00:18:20.410
You always gave me the
power and courage to fight.

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:22.210
That's why, Byakko!

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:27.140
Go, Driger!

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:46.690
What?!

00:18:46.690 --> 00:18:48.250
Impossible...

00:18:58.090 --> 00:18:59.470
Byakko...!

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:00.610
Byakko!

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:02.000
He's back!

00:19:04.100 --> 00:19:05.850
But the seal on the tablet...

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:07.900
What's happening, Ozma?

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:12.200
Dunga! Yusuf!
What are you doing?!

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:13.720
--Take this!

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:17.360
Not a chance!

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:30.420
Go, Byakko!

00:19:31.180 --> 00:19:33.320
Suzaku!

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:09.220
They did it!

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:11.410
They won! Wow!

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:15.200
Byakko responded to
Rei's feelings and returned!

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:28.660
Byakko, thanks
for coming back.

00:20:29.140 --> 00:20:31.880
Driger V2's at full power!

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:33.480
Driger V2?

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:36.780
Its tenacity and attack power...

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:42.380
With Byakko back in the upgraded
Driger, they have nothing to fear!

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:45.720
The seal...
No, that's impossible...

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:48.230
The seal shouldn't
be able to come undone!

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:50.100
You would never understand.

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:54.680
Just like Rei wanted Byakko,
Byakko wanted Rei.

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:56.400
That's all it is.

00:20:57.660 --> 00:20:58.400
Rei...

00:20:58.400 --> 00:20:59.680
Kai...

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:02.300
Look at that, Ozma!

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:05.760
This is how the
BBA team battles!

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:07.220
Got it?!

00:21:07.220 --> 00:21:09.620
We aren't done yet.

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:10.690
What?!

00:21:10.690 --> 00:21:14.270
Kinomiya,
your Seiryu is up next.

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:15.760
Ozma!

00:21:15.760 --> 00:21:19.710
I'm going to bury
Seiryu into that tablet!

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.680
Just try me!

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:24.620
Seiryu's not going anywhere!

00:23:00.410 --> 00:23:03.670
It's time for Takao and
Ozma to settle the score!

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:06.580
But what's up with
Ozma's scary faces?

00:23:06.580 --> 00:23:09.330
Don't make scary
faces like that!

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:13.170
So let's give him a
bad pun, Chairman!

00:23:13.170 --> 00:23:18.130
Huh? He's already gone?
But this is so important!

00:23:18.130 --> 00:23:21.410
Don't miss the
next episode-shields.
